## 📝 Setup Instructions

1. **Never commit `.env.local` or `.env` files to git**
2. Add these files to `.gitignore`:
   ```
   .env
   .env.local
   .env*.local
   ```
3. Create `.env.local` file in project root with all variables above
4. For production, set these in your hosting platform's environment variables

## 🚀 Production Checklist

- [ ] All secret keys are set in production environment
- [ ] Stripe keys are switched to live keys (not test keys)
- [ ] Supabase RLS (Row Level Security) policies are configured
- [ ] OAuth redirect URLs are updated for production domain
- [ ] API rate limiting is configured
- [ ] Environment variables are not exposed in client-side code

